---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const updated = "2026-08-22";
---

<Base
	title="Cookie Policy"
	description="How AVC Industrial Equipment uses cookies and similar technologies, and how to manage your choices."
>
	<div class="page">
		<section class="section">
			<h1 class="page-title">COOKIE POLICY</h1>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p class="lead">
				This page explains which cookies and similar technologies AVC Industrial Equipment Co., Ltd
				uses on this website, why we use them, and how you can change your choice at any time.
			</p>
			<p class="updated">Last updated: <time datetime={updated}>22 August 2026</time></p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">1. WHAT ARE COOKIES?</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>
				A cookie is a small text file a website stores on your device so it can recognise your
				browser on a later visit. Websites also use related technologies that behave the same way —
				this site uses <strong>localStorage</strong>, a browser storage area, to remember your cookie
				choice. Wherever this policy says “cookies”, it covers both.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">2. WHY AVC USES THEM</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<ul>
				<li>To make the site work — page navigation, security, and load balancing.</li>
				<li>To remember the language version you are reading.</li>
				<li>To remember your cookie choice, so we do not ask again on every page.</li>
				<li>
					In future, to understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it — only if you
					consent.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">3. CATEGORIES WE USE</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<div class="table-scroll">
				<table>
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th scope="col">Category</th>
							<th scope="col">Purpose</th>
							<th scope="col">Examples</th>
							<th scope="col">Retention</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row">Necessary</th>
							<td>Site operation, security, and storing your cookie choice. Cannot be switched off.</td>
							<td>
								<code>avc-consent</code> (localStorage), <code>avc_consent</code> (cookie), Cloudflare
								security cookie, EmDash admin session cookie (staff only)
							</td>
							<td>Up to 12 months; the admin session ends when the browser closes</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row">Functional</th>
							<td>
								Remembering choices such as language or region, and enabling embedded content such
								as maps and videos.
							</td>
							<td><em>AVC currently sets none.</em></td>
							<td>—</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row">Analytics</th>
							<td>
								Understanding how visitors use the site — pages viewed, time on page — in aggregate.
							</td>
							<td><em>AVC currently sets none.</em></td>
							<td>—</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row">Marketing</th>
							<td>Showing relevant advertising and measuring campaign effectiveness.</td>
							<td><em>AVC currently sets none.</em></td>
							<td>—</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
			<p>
				To be clear: this website does <strong>not</strong> currently set any functional, analytics or
				marketing cookies. They are described here so that if we ever enable one, it happens only with
				your consent and this page already tells you what it would do.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">4. THIRD PARTIES</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>
				The site is hosted and delivered by <strong>Cloudflare</strong>, which may set a cookie to
				distinguish legitimate visitors from automated traffic. This is a necessary security function.
			</p>
			<p>
				Web fonts are <strong>self-hosted</strong> from our own domain, so displaying this page sends
				no request to Google or any other font provider.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">5. MANAGING YOUR CHOICES</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>You can change or withdraw your choice at any time:</p>
			<p>
				<button type="button" class="btn" data-cc-open>Manage cookie preferences</button>
			</p>
			<p>
				The same link is in the footer of every page. You can also clear or block cookies in your
				browser settings — Chrome, Edge: <em>Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies</em>; Safari:
				<em>Settings → Privacy</em>; Firefox: <em>Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</em>. Note that
				blocking necessary cookies will stop parts of this site from working.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">6. YOUR RIGHTS</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>
				Where the GDPR applies, you have the right to access, correct and erase your personal data, to
				object to processing, and to withdraw consent at any time without detriment. In Vietnam, the
				processing of personal data is governed by <strong>Decree 13/2023/ND-CP</strong>. To exercise
				any of these rights, contact us using the details below.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">7. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>
				We may update this policy as the site changes. The “last updated” date at the top is
				authoritative. If a change materially affects how we use cookies, we will ask for your consent
				again rather than relying on your previous answer.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section prose">
			<h2 class="section-title">8. CONTACT</h2>
			<hr class="dashed-divider" />
			<p>
				AVC Industrial Equipment Co., Ltd<br />
				58 Nguyen Hoang, Binh Trung Ward, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam<br />
				Hotline <a href="tel:19000054">1900 0054</a> ·
				<a href="mailto:info@avc.equipment">info@avc.equipment</a>
			</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.page {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 44px 24px 80px;
	}

	.section {
		margin-bottom: 56px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: 26px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 2.5px;
		color: var(--color-brand);
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: 18px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 2.5px;
		color: var(--color-brand);
	}

	.dashed-divider {
		width: 210px;
		margin: 16px auto 28px;
		border: none;
		border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--avc-divider);
	}

	.lead {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto 16px;
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.updated {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
	}

	.prose {
		text-align: left;
	}

	.prose p,
	.prose li {
		font-size: 14.5px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.prose p + p,
	.prose ul {
		margin-top: var(--spacing-3);
	}

	.prose ul {
		padding-left: 20px;
	}

	.prose li + li {
		margin-top: 4px;
	}

	.prose a {
		color: var(--color-brand);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.prose code {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12.5px;
		background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
		padding: 1px 5px;
	}

	.table-scroll {
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	table {
		width: 100%;
		min-width: 640px;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
	}

	th,
	td {
		padding: 10px 12px;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		font-size: 13.5px;
		line-height: 1.55;
		text-align: left;
		vertical-align: top;
	}

	thead th {
		background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-brand);
	}

	tbody th {
		font-weight: 700;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 11px 26px;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-brand);
		background: var(--color-brand);
		color: var(--color-on-brand);
		font-family: inherit;
		font-size: 14px;
		border-radius: 0;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background var(--transition-fast);
	}

	.btn:hover {
		background: var(--color-brand-hover);
		border-color: var(--color-brand-hover);
	}

	.btn:focus-visible {
		outline-color: var(--color-bg);
		outline-offset: -5px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 540px) {
		.page-title {
			font-size: 20px;
		}

		.section-title {
			font-size: 16px;
		}
	}
</style>
